ll","x":"If this is the worst weather in a decade, $0.05 impact, let's assume it's something maybe $0.02 to $0.03 impact in the second quarters from the carryover and yet you still maintain the guidance range for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/kirby-kex-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KEX 2019 Q2","e":"kex","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Grzebinski","x":"We implemented cost reduction initiatives during the quarter, and we will continue to adjust our business as needed to limit the impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/kirby-kex-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KEX 2019 Q2","e":"kex","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Grzebinski","x":"In coastal, our actions to rightsize the fleet, improve horsepower efficiency and reduce our cost structure have paid off as evidenced by the return to profitability in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/kirby-kex-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KEX 2019 Q3","e":"kex","d":"2019-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Grzebinski","x":"And the price increases that we've gotten throughout this year will carry into a full year next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/26/kirby-kex-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KEX 2019 Q3","e":"kex","d":"2019-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Grzebinski","x":"So when you're trying to push price increases and you get a good weather quarter it's tough because you've got a little more barge availability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/26/kirby-kex-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KEX 2019 Q3","e":"kex","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Grzebinski","x":"As a result, we implemented additional cost reduction initiatives during the